--more  
Gradient Choir (i) is a sonic evolution from dark, granular glitch and sub-bass pulses into a soaring, machine-led epiphany. Formant-shifted voices morph from abstract vowels into lush, bit-crushed harmonies, ending in a bright, emancipated coda.  
